notes.content:
The following improvements and bug fixes have been made:

Slightly improved parkour system. It should now be easier to grab onto things (I'll continue to work on this);

Slightly improved camera behavior;

The game has been updated to have deeper gamepad support. Icons, menus, and so on will work with a gamepad if you play with it;

QTE was not displayed during the cat stage if a gamepad was connected to the PC

Improved the performance of music zones. Transitions sometimes occurred when they shouldn't have;

Final fix for a bug that sometimes caused not all letters to appear in animated text;

Improved the Iguana's ability to pull the player with its tongue;

You can hide behind obstacles from the Iguana's tongue;

Mouse Vision power recovery time was 30 seconds. Now 20;

If you take a stone, when it is highlighted by the power of Mouse Vision, it will shine endlessly;

Running takes less energy;

Edible grains sometimes did not disappear after being eaten;

Fixed some buggy flowers and bushes in Introduce Mode;

In Introduce Mode, after death, a checkpoint from Story Mode was loaded;

After loading a checkpoint, you could get to the cat's house if you completed the storyline there. This should not have happened - fixed;

A checkpoint preserves the location of objects that was moved;

Added some sound details to the location;

An action icon will appear above the item when you can actually pick it up;

Fixed a bug with mice that give items. Sometimes they would disappear before the player could find them;

Fixed a bug with the energy interface. When drinking coffee, a visual effect should have been applied to it (if you had full energy);

Many graphical elements have been updated, both in the game itself and in the main menu;

Increased plant rendering distance;

Fixed the main character model on medium and lower settings;

Fixed hats and other customization items hanging in the air in cutscenes;

Customization items now show up in cutscenes;

Fixed a bug with the combat system. You could hold down W + LMB and fight endlessly;

And many other small fixes.



Thank you for your interest in the game!

If you're enjoying the game, please consider leaving a review on Steam. It helps me a lot!

                                                [img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42168125/c3bb3a1d838e3241ea3dcf10b32aa0e323e693fe.png"]

Fixed a bug where the music for the cat scene would continue to play after the scene ended;

Slightly improved the cat's vision;

Fixed a bug that prevented achievements from being awarded for a new storyline.



I'm continuing to improve the demo. Thank you for your interest in the game!

Added a new storyline!

Added a new skin;

A new achievement has been added, which is related to the new storyline;

In the final cutscene, the text that says press T to end did not disappear;

In the final cutscene, the son had an interface that suggested pressing E to interact;

Fixed the checkpoint after the cat;

When you choose the Iguana skin, it said that you need to open it, but it is already open;

The settings did not correctly display the selected language, screen resolution, and graphics;



I'm continuing to fix other bugs. Thanks for your interest in the game!

Fixed a bug with hints. Not all words were displayed;

Fixed a bug that caused no music after the strange rat;

Added food in the battle with the boss Iguana;

When an Iguana uses its tongue, it can no longer pass through obstacles;

Fixed mouse customization items hanging in the air in cutscenes sometimes;

Fixed one subtitle in the dialogue with Iguana, which was in Ukrainian;

At the end, the demo was thrown into the wrong scene. So, you cant end demo and receive your points. Fixed.

I'm continuing to fix other bugs. Thanks for your interest in the game!
